Hypothesis RAok : L5.ra_ok r.
Hypothesis Rsp0 : getr R0 (reg 2) = Z_to_bv 64 S.
Hypothesis Rgp0 : getr R0 (reg 3) = Z_to_bv 64 (pa_gp AD).
Hypothesis Rtp0 : getr R0 (reg 4) = Z_to_bv 64 (hl_tp L).
